---

EXCEPTION — Street network data

The files map_2013.html through map_2026.html embed street-network
geometry derived from OpenStreetMap. That geometry is copyright
OpenStreetMap contributors and is made available under the Open Database
Licence (ODbL) 1.0:

  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

The ODbL requires that any adaptation of the database is released under
the same licence. The street coordinates embedded in the HTML files
constitute a Produced Work (a rendering of the database) and may be
freely used under ODbL terms, provided attribution is given to
OpenStreetMap contributors.

---

EXCEPTION — Base map tiles

The interactive maps load tiles from OpenStreetMap tile servers at
runtime. Those tiles are copyright OpenStreetMap contributors and are
served under CC BY-SA 2.0. No tiles are stored in this repository.
